{"id":464,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 4月23日下午5时，概率统计系在9号楼918会议室开展了本学期概率论与数理统计第三次集体备课活动，内容为“数理统计部分。会议由杨丽老师主持，邀请张峰老师主讲，承担概率论与数理统计课程的教师们参加了此次集体备课活动。<br /></p><p>张峰老师为大家展示了讲解数理统计部分内容的方式方法，其中部分知识点通过图例、实例和形象直观的公式帮助同学们理解和记忆，让人耳目一新；内容的处理上有一定深度的拓展，可以引发同学们的研究兴趣；多处概率史和课程思政的引入自然又贴切，值得任课教师们学习。随后，老师们就自己在概率论与数理统计备课中遇到的疑问和困惑展开积极讨论。</p><p>集体备课为老师们提供了一个共同探讨，共同学习的平台，大家一起集思广益，互相取长补短，共享资源，共同进步。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Yol74iL4-aM7QfM84GbnRTfUlVVnRNiZM4Q7MzlPoRCZL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyiokh7okhfLR-YUlMkUmUsMRNYM77ZMzN8n7V7M4-aLzVFM49YLRvbUmWFL4l4nlCJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGPg4LsoR7JqdDnx&oid=1867244289&tid=1101&nid=3781&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/158D8A022ACBB474924A8594DAD72011/782079B2/353EF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Yol74iL4-aM7QfM84GbnRTfUlVVnRNiZM4Q7MzlPoRCZL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyiokh7okhfLR-YUlMkUmUsMRNYM77ZMzN8n7V7M4-aLzVFM49YLRvbUmWFL4l4nlCJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGPg4LsoR7JqdDnx&oid=1867244289&tid=1101&nid=3781&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YnzN4DMR94U8Csn8mLsozfVM8M7LRfiVo7CYUmA7nl-boRU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybUYyZoSybnN-PnRvbnzU4oln2n7QfU4f7MRWVn77YM8QFLNnVnRUsM8QFL4GiUNCJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGPg4LsoR7JqdDnx&oid=1867244289&tid=1101&nid=3781&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F9C899FB1D79E439DFDFAC0D42EDA27F/2DED477F/305BF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YnzN4DMR94U8Csn8mLsozfVM8M7LRfiVo7CYUmA7nl-boRU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybUYyZoSybnN-PnRvbnzU4oln2n7QfU4f7MRWVn77YM8QFLNnVnRUsM8QFL4GiUNCJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGPg4LsoR7JqdDnx&oid=1867244289&tid=1101&nid=3781&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://math.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Yol74iL4-aM7QfM84GbnRTfUlVVnRNiZM4Q7MzlPoRCZL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyiokh7okhfLR-YUlMkUmUsMRNYM77ZMzN8n7V7M4-aLzVFM49YLRvbUmWFL4l4nlCJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGPg4LsoR7JqdDnx&oid=1867244289&tid=1101&nid=37